    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d372">

                <pb facs="0596" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg526"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Romero</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-02-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 5, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 9th ultimo, containing a copy of a communication addressed
                    to you by Mr. de Tejada relative to the change of the channel of the Rio Grande
                    on the boundary between Mexico and the United States.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to state that the views of this government on the
                    subject complained of are expressed in the opinion given on November 11th, 1856,
                    by the then Attorney General of the United States, a copy of which is herewith
                    transmitted.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion to renew to you the assurances of my most
                    distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Romero,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d372-a1.xml" xpointer="d372-a1"/>
            </div>
